### Git Ignore Rules

# 1. 打包與發布二進位產物 (Pack Archives & Exports)
# 排除本機打包測試或發布之壓縮檔案，防止二進位大型檔案膨脹 Git 歷程
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
*.rar

# 2. 作業系統中繼資料與暫存檔 (Operating System Metadata)
# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.DocumentRevisions-V100/
.fseventsd/
.Spotlight-V100/
.TemporaryItems/
.Trashes/
.VolumeIcon.icns

# Linux
*~
.directory
.fuse_hidden*
.nfs*

# 3. 編輯器與 IDE 本機設定 (IDEs & Code Editors)
# Visual Studio Code
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace

# JetBrains IDEs (IntelliJ IDEA, WebStorm, PyCharm 等)
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# Visual Studio
.vs/

# Vim / Emacs 臨時備份檔
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
*.backup
*.old
*.orig
.#*

# 4. 日誌與暫存目錄 (Logs & Temporary Files)
*.log
logs/
crash-reports/
tmp/
temp/
scratch/

# 5. 建置與腳本快取 (Build Tools & Script Caches - 若有引入工具鏈)
node_modules/
dist/
src-tauri/target/
target/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.cache/

# 6. 環境變數與機密資訊 (Environment & Secrets)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local